{"id":"311336","name":"脆口香辣萝卜干","author":"美食C位","authorId":"6867953","desc":"","cover":"images/311336/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"50g"},{"name":"萝卜干","amount":"1把"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"2g"},{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"2个"},{"name":"油辣椒","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1茶匙"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"萝卜干用清水泡发。","img":"images/311336/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猪肉切丝，蒜苗和干辣椒切成小段。","img":"images/311336/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"泡好的萝卜干挤干水分，用刀剁几下。","img":"images/311336/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅凉油放入猪肉丝煸炒。","img":"images/311336/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入一勺辣椒油。","img":"images/311336/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒出红油以后放入干辣椒和蒜苗。","img":"images/311336/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入萝卜干，大火翻炒。","img":"images/311336/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"调入盐和生抽。","img":"images/311336/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后放蒜苗叶，翻炒几下出锅。","img":"images/311336/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/311336/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"口感脆脆的。","img":"images/311336/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"萝卜干要提前两小时泡发。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}